h is your bag?"], "explicacion": "Which + is + sujeto.", "t": "ej", "id": "n45-s05-e10"}, {"tipo": "escribir", "subtipo": "completar", "q": "___ is the test? (cuándo)", "respuestas": ["When"], "explicacion": "cuándo = when.", "t": "ej", "id": "n45-s05-e11"}, {"tipo": "escribir", "subtipo": "completar", "q": "How ___ books do you have?", "respuestas": ["many"], "explicacion": "Plural contable → many.", "t": "ej", "id": "n45-s05-e12"}, {"tipo": "escribir", "subtipo": "traducir", "q": "Escribe en inglés: ¿Por qué estás cansado?", "respuestas": ["Why are you tired?"], "explicacion": "Why + are + you.", "t": "ej", "id": "n45-s05-e13"}, {"tipo": "escribir", "subtipo": "completar", "q": "___ time is it?", "respuestas": ["What"], "explicacion": "What time.", "t": "ej", "id": "n45-s05-e14"}]}